unched a television campaign. Lee holds a slight cash-on-hand edge and has been legislating on issues tailored to Nevada, including gaming tax provisions and trafficking survivor support. Republicans see the district as a target, with a Trump-aligned super PAC entering the race and the 'no tax on tips' policy resonating with the district's large service-industry workforce. O'Donnell has also faced a residency controversy. Expert raters mostly call the race Likely Democratic, with a few at Lean or Safe Democratic, and prediction markets price Lee's chances around 94%. With no public general-election polls, the forecast rests on fundamentals, ratings, and market pricing, all pointing to a clear but not insurmountable Lee advantage.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9366, "margin": 9.91}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9036, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9329, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9282, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9091, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.906, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9242, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.942, "margin": 10.2}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.921, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9325, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.93, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9287, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.8974, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.905, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9112, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.8961, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9316, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9282, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9294, "margin": 10.5}]}